  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "A marathon is a long running race of 26.2 miles.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first Olympic marathon was held in Athens.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Now, many cities host their own marathons every year.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Themes of marathons add fun and meaning to the hard miles.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Runners run for helping sick kids, celebrating important events, or just enjoying nature.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "There is a famous marathon in Gisborne, New Zealand, which is known for being the first city in the world to welcome the sunlight every day.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Runners can greet the sunrise as they race along the golden sandy beaches.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Marathon routes bring people more understanding of the old sport.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Some routes provide great sporting challenges for runners.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The routes offer various surfaces, from bridges to sand to hills.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Runners of all skill levels can sweat freely and push their limits in the race.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Some routes are well planned for runners to explore the many sides of a city.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "For example, the route of the Great Wall Marathon takes the runners along the great wonder of the world.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "The race can be an amazing chance to get to know Beijing, its people and local food.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "A marathon is quite a journey for runners to enjoy the run, challenge themselves and experience the culture.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "There is so much more behind the race for us to explore.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
